{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ごきげんよう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "森平麗心です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobOkjXe7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobTy3XBO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お菓子くれないとイタズラしちゃうぞ🍬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10月26日（日）オンラインミート＆グリート\nありがとうございました🌟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はじめてハロウィンコスプレでお話できて\n思い出が増えましたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもありがとう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この間は体調が崩れてしまったので\nなんか久しぶりにお話した気分☺、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好き〜と改めて思いました。🫶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はじめましての方も！　( ⸝⸝⸝ᵕ ᵕ⸝⸝⸝ )♡ᐝ\n楽しかったですし、緊張しました！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "上手く話せたかな〜笑。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも沢山質問してくださってとっても嬉しいです！\n私からも聞きたいこととかあって、、\n今度また話そ〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobiMo3eP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、\nコスプレはズートピアのジュディちゃん🐰🚓！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は短めなんですけど、\nお見せしたくて載せました📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46メッセージアプリも6期生が加わります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ん〜\nなんかもっと距離が縮まるような、、\nそんなメッセージを送りたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "＃ハッシュタグも考えたいな〜💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "森平麗心"}], "source": "official"}